<title>USA: IBM, Mastercard, Danish Internet deal.</title>
<headline>IBM, Mastercard, Danish Internet deal.</headline>
<dateline>SOMERS, N.Y. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBM Corp said Monday it and Mastercard and Danish Payment Systems helped make what it described as the first credit car payment via the Internet.</p>
</text>
